title: "quadrotor-prescribed-time-smc: prescribed-time sliding mode position tracking for quadrotors"
abstract: "A dual-loop position controller for quadrotors combining a prescribed-time sliding-mode outer loop, attitude-command low-pass filtering and a segmented SMC-to-PID hand-over, with MATLAB sources, Python reference implementation and reproducible data."
